WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:03.402
Unit four. Digital Pictures!

2
00:00:04.372 --> 00:00:09.005
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.055 --> 00:00:12.835
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.886 --> 00:00:16.657
Today we learn about Digital Pictures. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.435 --> 00:00:21.201
Photo. Say it with me. Photo!

6
00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:28.299
Camera. Say it with me. Camera!

7
00:00:31.873 --> 00:00:35.773
Save. Say it with me. Save!

8
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.933
Folder. Say it with me. Folder!

9
00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:50.357
Picture. Say it with me. Picture!

10
00:00:53.857 --> 00:00:57.790
Screen. Say it with me. Screen!

11
00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:05.109
Colorful. Say it with me. Colorful!

12
00:01:08.656 --> 00:01:12.606
Share. Say it with me. Share!

13
00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:27.752
I can take a photo with a camera and save it on the computer. My pictures go into a folder so I can find them later. I only share a colorful picture with people my family trusts.

14
00:01:27.802 --> 00:01:31.153
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:31.885 --> 00:01:37.187
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.237 --> 00:01:38.387
Save!

17
00:01:39.364 --> 00:01:44.997
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.047 --> 00:01:46.225
Colorful!

19
00:01:47.328 --> 00:01:57.352
Did you know? The very first digital photo ever taken was in 1957, and it was a simple black-and-white picture!

20
00:01:57.402 --> 00:02:00.533
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:01.812 --> 00:02:11.131
Think and answer. What is your favorite kind of picture to take or make?

22
00:02:11.181 --> 00:02:12.355
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:19.354
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.404 --> 00:02:22.512
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

